{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 5, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "## Lost in Translation (and Loving It!)\n\nJust back from an incredible trip to Japan, and I'm still processing everything! It’s a country of beautiful contrasts – ancient temples nestled beside futuristic skyscrapers, bustling cityscapes giving way to serene mountain trails. \n\nMy journey started in Tokyo, a sensory overload in the best way possible. Shibuya Crossing was mesmerizing, and exploring the vibrant Harajuku district was a feast for the eyes. I indulged in some amazing ramen and discovered hidden cafes serving the most delicious matcha lattes.\n\nFrom Tokyo, I took the Shinkansen (bullet train!) to Kyoto. This city felt like stepping back in time.  I wandered through stunning bamboo forests, visited iconic temples like Kinkaku-ji (the Golden Pavilion), and learned about traditional tea ceremonies.  \n\nFood was a highlight everywhere.  I tried everything from fresh sushi to savory okonomiyaki.  And the politeness of the people was truly remarkable.  Even with limited Japanese, smiles and gestures went a long way. \n\nJapan is a place that challenges your perceptions and leaves you wanting more.  It’s a trip I’ll cherish forever.  Highly recommend adding it to your bucket list!\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "##", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "▁Lost", "logprob": -0.001968828495591879}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.1512632817029953}, {"token": "▁Translation", "logprob": -0.0006672301678918302}, {"token": "▁(", "logprob": -0.407469779253006}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -0.0006516240537166595}, {"token": "▁Loving", "logprob": -0.0003580405900720507}, {"token": "▁It", "logprob": -0.0002411313180346042}, {"token": "!)", "logprob": -0.24601107835769653}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -2.276477098464966}, {"token": "Just", "logprob": -1.3134348392486572}, {"token": "▁back", "logprob": -0.21641722321510315}, {"token": "▁from", "log